#: model:ir.model.fields,help:planning_crew_rotation.field_planning_crew_rotation_generate__count_warnings
msgid ""
"Shifts that break a rule of the Labour Code for the employee (rest, weekly "
"hours, night work); they are created with a warning."
msgstr ""
"Смени, които нарушават правило на КТ за служителя (почивка, седмични часове,"
" нощен труд); създават се с предупреждение."

#. module: planning_crew_rotation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:planning_crew_rotation.field_planning_slot__crew_warning
msgid ""
"What the shift breaks in the Labour Code for this employee (rest, weekly "
"hours, night work). Warning only — the shift is kept."
msgstr ""
"Какво от КТ нарушава смяната за този служител (почивка, седмични часове, "
"нощен труд). Само предупреждение — смяната остава."

#. module: planning_crew_rotation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:planning_crew_rotation.field_planning_crew_rotation__norm_html
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:planning_crew_rotation.planning_crew_rotation_view_form
msgid "Working Time Norm"
msgstr "Норма на работното време"

#. module: planning_crew_rotation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:planning_crew_rotation.planning_crew_rotation_view_form
msgid ""
"employees are scheduled above\n"
"                                the norm of the period — the hours above it are overtime."
msgstr ""
"служители са по графика над\n"
"                                нормата за периода — часовете над нея са извънреден труд."

#. module: planning_crew_rotation
#: code:addons/planning_crew_rotation/models/planning_crew_rotation.py:0
msgid "less than 12 h rest between shifts (Labour Code, Art. 152)"
msgstr "по-малко от 12 ч почивка между смените (чл. 152 КТ)"

#. module: planning_crew_rotation
#: code:addons/planning_crew_rotation/models/planning_crew_rotation.py:0
msgid "less than 24 h weekly rest (Labour Code, Art. 153)"
msgstr "по-малко от 24 ч седмична почивка (чл. 153 КТ)"

#. module: planning_crew_rotation
#: code:addons/planning_crew_rotation/models/planning_crew_rotation.py:0
msgid "more than 56 h in 7 days (Labour Code, Art. 142)"
msgstr "над 56 ч за 7 дни (чл. 142 КТ)"

#. module: planning_crew_rotation
#: code:addons/planning_crew_rotation/models/planning_crew_rotation.py:0
msgid "night work is forbidden in pregnancy / IVF (Labour Code, Art. 140)"
msgstr "нощен труд е забранен при бременност / ин витро (чл. 140 КТ)"

#. module: planning_crew_rotation
#: code:addons/planning_crew_rotation/models/planning_crew_rotation.py:0
msgid "night work needs written consent (Labour Code, Art. 140)"
msgstr "нощен труд само с писмено съгласие (чл. 140 КТ)"

#. module: planning_crew_rotation
#: code:addons/planning_crew_rotation/models/planning_crew_rotation.py:0
msgid "night work under 18 is forbidden (Labour Code, Art. 140)"
msgstr "нощен труд под 18 години е забранен (чл. 140 КТ)"

#. module: planning_crew_rotation
#: code:addons/planning_crew_rotation/models/planning_crew_rotation.py:0
msgid "no medical exam for night work (Labour Code, Art. 140a)"
msgstr "няма медицински преглед за нощен труд (чл. 140а КТ)"

#. module: planning_crew_rotation
#: code:addons/planning_crew_rotation/models/planning_crew_rotation.py:0
msgid "overlaps another shift"
msgstr "застъпва се с друга смяна"

#. module: planning_crew_rotation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:planning_crew_rotation.field_planning_slot__crew_warning_codes
msgid "Crew Warning Codes"
msgstr "Кодове на предупрежденията"

#. module: planning_crew_rotation
#: code:addons/planning_crew_rotation/models/hr_employee.py:0
msgid "%s has no running contract: the crew is kept in the contract."
msgstr "%s няма текущ договор: бригадата се води в договора."
